    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AVA DUVERNAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ava DuVernay is a filmmaker who directed, wrote, and produced the movie 'Vernay I Will Follow', and also starred in it alongside Salli Mayeux."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ava DuVernay is the writer, producer, and director of the 2010 film 'I Will Follow', starring Salli Richardson-Whitfield and others."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0380-2ed353c21423</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAYE&quot;">
